        "code": "panel/server/src/index.ts:494-511"
      },
      {
        "title": "打开 iframe",
        "detail": "GET /desktop/:id/：会话校验 → userCanAccess → attachViewer（接管判定）→ 反代注入 Basic。",
        "highlight": [
