        "title": "WebSocket 升级",
        "detail": "raw upgrade 单独做三道闸门：实例网段拒绝、Host 白名单、cookie + 实例权限；然后 proxy.ws。",
        "highlight": [
          "api",
          "kasm"
        ],
        "code": "panel/server/src/index.ts:1947-2035"
      },
      {
        "title": "单连接接管",
        "detail": "每个页面一个 viewer id；新页面连上时旧页面记为 superseded 并断 socket，被接管页面自动重连返回 409。",
        "highlight": [
          "api",
          "kasm"
        ],
        "code": "panel/server/src/index.ts:1092-1141"
      },
      {
        "title": "输入中文",
        "detail": "前端 compositionend 整串发送 → /type 借容器剪贴板 + Ctrl+V；图片走 /paste-image。",
        "highlight": [
